{"seq":13,"slug":"observability","title":"可观测性","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可观测性-简介\">可观测性 简介</h1><p>现代软件系统正变得越来越庞大、越来越分散——一个请求可能要穿过几十个服务、跨越众多机器。当这样的系统出了问题，我们如何知道哪里出了错、为什么会出错？仅仅&quot;监控&quot;那些预先设想到的指标，已远远不够。可观测性（observability）正是为应对这一挑战而生：它追求让系统的内部状态，能通过其对外输出的数据被充分理解，从而让我们能探究那些事先未曾预料到的问题。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦&quot;如何让复杂系统变得可被理解&quot;这一核心命题——它讲的是<strong>数据与理解</strong>（系统吐出什么信号、我们如何凭这些信号看懂系统内部），而不是&quot;如何让系统更可靠&quot;或&quot;如何主动验证韧性&quot;。后两者分别属于站点可靠性工程与混沌工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>可观测性常与几个相邻领域纠缠在一起，厘清边界能帮你在正确的 hub 找到正确的答案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想解决的问题</th>\n<th>该看的 hub</th>\n<th>核心区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统出了问题，如何凭数据看懂&quot;哪里错、为什么&quot;</td>\n<td><strong>可观测性（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>关注理解系统：指标、日志、链路追踪三大支柱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何用工程方法经营系统的可靠性（SLO、错误预算、事故响应、消除杂活）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../site-reliability-engineering/\">站点可靠性工程</a></td>\n<td>可观测数据是 SRE 的事实来源；SRE 用它做可靠性决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何主动注入故障、验证系统的韧性</td>\n<td><a href=\"../chaos-engineering/\">混沌工程与韧性</a></td>\n<td>混沌实验靠可观测性&quot;看见实际发生了什么&quot;、靠 SLO 判定&quot;是否扛住&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何安全地发布变更（蓝绿、金丝雀、回滚）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ci-cd-pipelines/\">CI/CD 流水线</a></td>\n<td>金丝雀等策略依赖可观测信号来控风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何把可观测能力作为平台能力提供给开发者</td>\n<td><a href=\"../platform-engineering/\">平台工程</a> / <a href=\"../internal-developer-platform/\">内部开发者平台</a></td>\n<td>关注可观测性平台的搭建与集成，而非概念本身</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话记忆：<strong>可观测性让系统&quot;可被理解&quot;，SRE 让系统&quot;被可靠地经营&quot;，混沌工程&quot;主动检验&quot;这种可靠，CI/CD 与平台工程则把这些能力&quot;落到发布与平台里&quot;。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-内容\">本 hub 内容</h2><p>全书分四章，由浅入深：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可观测性基础</strong>——可观测性的含义、它与传统&quot;监控&quot;的区别、以及它赖以建立的三大支柱（指标、日志、链路追踪）的概貌。</li>\n<li><strong>指标与日志</strong>——三大支柱中的两个：指标（系统状态的数值度量，含&quot;四个黄金信号&quot;）与日志（系统行为的事件记录，含结构化与集中式管理）。</li>\n<li><strong>链路追踪与告警</strong>——第三大支柱&quot;分布式链路追踪&quot;，以及如何从可观测数据走向有效的告警与服务等级目标。</li>\n<li><strong>实践与意义</strong>——三大支柱如何协同、可观测性如何驱动开发、常见的陷阱与权衡，并升华到可观测性的工程文化意义。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>初学者 / 想建立完整认知</strong>：按章节顺序通读一至四章。第一章建立理念框架，二、三章深入三大支柱与告警，第四章上升到实践与文化。这是默认且最稳妥的路径。</li>\n<li><strong>开发者（想让自己的代码可被排查）</strong>：先读第一章建立框架 → 直奔 <a href=\"practice-and-significance/observability-driven-development\">可观测性驱动开发</a> → 回头补 <a href=\"metrics-and-logging/metrics\">指标</a>、<a href=\"metrics-and-logging/logging\">日志</a>、<a href=\"tracing-and-alerting/distributed-tracing\">分布式链路追踪</a> 三柱的具体写法。</li>\n<li><strong>运维 / 值班人员（想把信号变成有效响应）</strong>：第一章 → <a href=\"metrics-and-logging/golden-signals\">四个黄金信号</a> → <a href=\"tracing-and-alerting/alerting\">告警</a> → <a href=\"tracing-and-alerting/slo-and-error-budget\">服务等级目标与错误预算</a>，再跨到 SRE hub 的事故响应。</li>\n<li><strong>架构 / 平台负责人（想成体系地建设）</strong>：通读后重点看 <a href=\"practice-and-significance/pillars-synergy\">三大支柱的协同</a> 与 <a href=\"practice-and-significance/pitfalls-and-tradeoffs\">常见陷阱与权衡</a>，再跨到平台工程的可观测性平台。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>阅读时把握一条主线：可观测性追求让复杂系统的内部状态变得可被理解、可被探究——它通过指标、日志、链路追踪等多维数据，使我们不仅能发现&quot;系统出了问题&quot;，更能探究&quot;问题出在哪、为什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>对软件系统的基本认知：知道什么是服务、请求、进程、资源（处理器/内存）。</li>\n<li>了解分布式系统的基本形态：一个系统可由多个服务、多台机器组成，彼此通过网络协作。</li>\n<li>无需运维背景或特定工具经验；本 hub 讲的是理念与原理，不绑定任何具体产品。</li>\n<li>若想进一步把&quot;理解系统&quot;延伸到&quot;经营系统之可靠&quot;，建议在读完本 hub 后衔接 <a href=\"../site-reliability-engineering/\">站点可靠性工程</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-foundations","title":"第一章 可观测性基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/observability-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-observability","title":"什么是可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/observability-foundations/what-is-observability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-vs-monitoring","title":"可观测性与监控的区别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/observability-foundations/observability-vs-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"three-pillars","title":"三大支柱概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/observability-foundations/three-pillars"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-and-logging","title":"第二章 指标与日志","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/metrics-and-logging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metrics","title":"指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/metrics-and-logging/metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"golden-signals","title":"四个黄金信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/metrics-and-logging/golden-signals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"logging","title":"日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/metrics-and-logging/logging"},{"seq":4,"slug":"structured-and-centralized-logging","title":"结构化与集中式日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/metrics-and-logging/structured-and-centralized-logging"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tracing-and-alerting","title":"第三章 链路追踪与告警","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/tracing-and-alerting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/tracing-and-alerting/distributed-tracing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"alerting","title":"告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/tracing-and-alerting/alerting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"slo-and-error-budget","title":"服务等级目标与错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/tracing-and-alerting/slo-and-error-budget"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice-and-significance","title":"第四章 实践与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/practice-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pillars-synergy","title":"三大支柱的协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/practice-and-significance/pillars-synergy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-driven-development","title":"可观测性驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/practice-and-significance/observability-driven-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls-and-tradeoffs","title":"常见陷阱与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/practice-and-significance/pitfalls-and-tradeoffs"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"意义与工程文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/observability/practice-and-significance/significance"}]}]}